                                        <span className="field__hint">{"Some hotels agree a rate that already includes GST (for example ₹5,000 net to the guest). Choose \"Tax inclusive\" and the system finds the room charge and the GST from that figure, so the bill always ends at exactly the amount agreed. The slab (5 % up to ₹7,500, 18 % above) comes from the Taxes setup."}</span>
