                                        <span className="field__hint">{"Examples of the reverse calculation (room charge = price ÷ 1.05 or ÷ 1.18, then CGST and SGST in equal halves, rounded to the paisa). Prices between ₹7,875 and ₹8,850 fall between the two slabs: the system uses 18 % and marks the booking \"check the tax slab\" for the Front Office Manager. Extra bed, meals and add-ons keep their own GST."}</span>
